OL,3,GNEWSAVandalism of Sean Graham
OL,4,Abookmakers memorial 'hurtful and
OL,5,Ahateful', families say
OL,6,
OL,7,FFamilies of those murdered in the Sean
OL,8,FGraham bookmakers shootings have said
OL,9,Fthe vandalism of a memorial is "very
OL,10,Fhurtful and hateful".
OL,12,FFive people were murdered in the Ulster
OL,13,FDefence Association (UDA) attack on the
OL,14,FOrmeau Road in south Belfast in 1992.
OL,15,FSeven other people were injured.
OL,17,FA memorial plaque of those killed in
OL,18,Fthe attack was smeared with white paint
OL,19,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
